00:08:13.980 --> 00:08:17.637
So now let's take
our second part.

00:08:17.637 --> 00:08:19.220
Let's talk about our
customer journey.

00:08:19.220 --> 00:08:23.060
So a lot of our customers have
been running their data centers

00:08:23.060 --> 00:08:23.780
